# RepoLens local dev secrets template.
#
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in real values. `.dev.vars` is
# git-ignored. All values come from the manual GitHub App registration
# (docs/MASTER_BUILD_PROMPT.md §6) and Google AI Studio — never invent them.
#
# GH_APP_ID is a plain var in wrangler.jsonc (not secret); the three values
# below are Wrangler secrets in production (wrangler secret put <NAME>).

GH_APP_ID=
GH_PRIVATE_KEY=
GH_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
